  "bis 30 fps bei 4K Ultra HD": "up to 30 fps at 4K Ultra HD",
  "Bis 30 m": "Up to 30 m",
  "bis 30 m, 18× SMD IR-LEDs": "up to 30 m, 18× SMD IR LEDs",
